#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
asm - Agent Session Manager (Pure Python, local index)

Index architecture:
  reindex → builds JSON index from local .jsonl files (~/opt/agent-session-manager/data/indexes/)
  resume  → reads from local index for fast disk I/O
  close   → terminates a running session, leaving it resumable

Commands:
  asm resume [OPTIONS] [KEYWORD...]   Find and resume a past Claude Code session
  asm close  [OPTIONS] [KEYWORD...]   Find and close a running session
  asm reindex                         Re-index all sessions now

  asm --version                       Show version
  asm --help                          Show this help
"""

